  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Total number of ions from the following with noble gas configuration is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Sr</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Cs</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>La</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Yb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>)</mo><mtext> and </mtext><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Noble gas configuration<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>ns</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>np</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>38</mn></msub><msup><mi>Sr</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>[</mo><mn>36</mn></msub><mi>Kr</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Cs</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>[</mo><mn>54</mn></msub><mi>Xe</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><msub><mi>Yb</mi><mn>70</mn></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>[</mo><mn>54</mn></msub><mi>Xe</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>14</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>57</mn></msub><msup><mi>La</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>[</mo><mn>54</mn></msub><mi>Xe</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>82</mn></msub><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>[</mo><mn>54</mn></msub><mi>Xe</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>14</mn></msup><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mn>6</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>26</mn></msub><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>[</mo><mn>18</mn></msub><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cs</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math> and  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Sr</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> have noble gas configuration, which are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Xe</mi><mo> </mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Kr</mi></math>, respectively.</p><p>Hence, the answer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>.</p>",
